DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31473::$$$message_0245_0000_0000$$$::I walk up the long hill road to the church.[lr]::
31474::$$$message_0245_0000_0001$$$::The night is dark.[lr]::
31475::$$$message_0245_0000_0002$$$::There isn't a cloud in the sky, but the moon is dark.[lr]::
31476::$$$message_0245_0000_0003$$$::The only meaningful source of light comes from the church...::
31477::$$$message_0245_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31478::$$$message_0245_0001_0001$$$::A ghost/woman stands in the courtyard.[lr]::
31479::$$$message_0245_0001_0002$$$::She reminds me of a weeping willow.::
31480::$$$message_0245_0002_0000$$$::"You..."[lr]::
31481::$$$message_0245_0002_0001$$$::...This is a dream.[lr]::
31482::$$$message_0245_0002_0002$$$::...When did it become a dream?[lr]::
31483::$$$message_0245_0002_0003$$$::...I know I'm seeing her for the first time, we shouldn't have met before, but I feel like I know her well...::
31484::$$$message_0245_0003_0000$$$::"...Eh?"[lr]::
31485::$$$message_0245_0003_0001$$$::...The woman walks past me like I'm not even there.::
31486::$$$message_0245_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31487::$$$message_0245_0004_0001$$$::...I absently watch the ghost go.[lr]::
31488::$$$message_0245_0004_0002$$$::...I don't need to run after her.[lr]::
31489::$$$message_0245_0004_0003$$$::...This is a dream, after all.[lr]::
31490::$$$message_0245_0004_0004$$$::...She'd just disappear as soon as I caught up to her,[lr]::
31491::$$$message_0245_0004_0005$$$::and even if I tried to chase her, these things wouldn't let me pass.::
31492::$$$message_0245_0005_0000$$$::                                           "[line len=3], [line len=3], [line len=3]!"[rf]::
31493::$$$message_0245_0006_0000$$$::I hear a familiar chorus.[lr]::
31494::$$$message_0245_0006_0001$$$::Someone told me not to go near the church alone, and this is what I get for forgetting that.[lr]::
31495::$$$message_0245_0006_0002$$$::...But I'm lucky this time.[lr]::
31496::$$$message_0245_0006_0003$$$::Fortunately, I'm in a dream. All I need to do is open my eyes to see my usual bedroom ceiling[line len=2]::
31497::$$$message_0245_0007_0000$$$::"Guh...grrgh."[lr]::
31498::$$$message_0245_0007_0001$$$::Wicked claws pierce my liver.[r][font color=0xEF0326]                                                                                                  (stomach)[rf][lr]::
31499::$$$message_0245_0007_0002$$$::Like a strawberry on a fork.[r][font color=0xEF0326]                                                                                                  (leg)[rf][lr]::
31500::$$$message_0245_0007_0003$$$::They skewer all my joints, my neck, even my face.[r][font color=0xEF0326]                                                                                                  (neck)[rf][lr]::
31501::$$$message_0245_0007_0004$$$::I have no throat and I cannot scream. Whistling air...[r][font color=0xEF0326]                                                                                                  (help)[rf]::
31502::$$$message_0245_0008_0000$$$::Aaaaahhh.[lr]::
31503::$$$message_0245_0008_0001$$$::something sharp    digs    into my brain[lr]::
31504::$$$message_0245_0008_0002$$$::It's so painful, so irritating, that it makes me want to tear up a stuffed animal in revenge.[lr]::
31505::$$$message_0245_0008_0003$$$::Like stabbing the defenseless doll with a kitchen knife. An act of slaughter even a child could do, so simple that it's incredibly pointless/boring.[lr]::
31506::$$$message_0245_0008_0004$$$::It's awful, disgusting, and leaves the worst taste in my mouth. In other words, I'm playing the role of that stuffed animal right now.::
31507::$$$message_0245_0009_0000$$$::...Still, I'll be okay.[lr]::
31508::$$$message_0245_0009_0001$$$::This is a dream.[lr]::
31509::$$$message_0245_0009_0002$$$::Once this [font italic=true]crunchy[font italic=false] affair ends, [l]it'll be like it never happened, [l]everything will be gone, [l]and I'll wake up in my next form...::
931473::$$$message_9245_0000_0000$$$::I walk up the long hill road to the church.[r]::

